*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0003
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 660
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0003.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0003C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM AGE-FEE-RULES
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
AGE-FEE-RULES.
    *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
    IF CU-STUDENT-FLAG = 'Y' AND CU-CLNT-AGE < 25
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE IF CU-CLNT-AGE >= 60
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF
    END-IF.
